sequence Take the payment

box shop as Shop desk
box payments as Payment company
box store as Warehouse

step Ask for the money
  say The shop asks the payment company for the order's money.
  shop -> payments: Charge
step Learn it is paid
  say The payment company replies that the payment went through.
  payments -> shop: Paid
step Pass it on
  say The shop passes the paid order to the warehouse.
  shop -> store: Paid order
